{"title":"广州市住建局印发《广州市智能建造项目评价指引（2.0版）》","date":"2026-08-25","content":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">广州市住建局印发《广州市智能建造项目评价指引（2.0版）》</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n\t\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202608/1-1(2).png\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"75265\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(254, 248, 228);border-radius:10px;padding:15px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);border-radius:8px;padding:15px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"letter-spacing:0.57834px;font-size:16px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>广州市住房和城乡建设局关于印发《广州市智能建造项目评价指引（2.0版）》的通知</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"letter-spacing:0.57834px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"letter-spacing:0.57834px;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.75em;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t各有关单位：</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.75em;font-size:17px;text-indent:2.11765em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t为贯彻落实广州市现代化产业体系建设战略部署，大力推动智能建造与工业化建筑产业发展，我局在《广州市智能建造项目评价指引（1.0版）》实施经验基础上，编制了《广州市智能建造项目评价指引（2.0版）》，现予以印发。请各有关单位按照评价指引，组织谋划和应用智能建造技术，提升项目智能建造水平。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.75em;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t特此通知。</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.75em;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.75em;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:16px;letter-spacing:0.57834px;text-align:right;line-height:1.75em;font-size:17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t广州市住房和城乡建设局</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.57834px; line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.57834px; line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.57834px; line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.57834px; line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t附 件：</p>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.57834px; line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 17px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/files/cms/article/202608/%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E5%B8%82%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E5%BB%BA%E9%80%A0%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E8%AF%84%E4%BB%B7%E6%8C%87%E5%BC%95%EF%BC%882_0%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.doc\">广州市智能建造项目评价指引（2.0版）</a></p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>"}